alx-tune (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite Milestone M3.
  * Implement hardware profile detection (alx-profile-low / alx-profile-mid).
  * Configure zram, earlyoom, fallback swapfile, I/O scheduler udev rules,
    service disabling, and per-user systemd resource limits idempotently.
  * Add first-boot systemd oneshot service and alx-tune(8) man page.

